#c45[i4] Claims and probes must have unique IDs; the parser throws an HcsSyntaxError if a duplicate ID is encountered.
  > src/format.ts:181 #9e8a05d0e3f3
#c46[i5] Indented lines starting with '>' are parsed as anchors, '=' as probe answers, '~' as claim references, and '|' as text continuations.
  > src/format.ts:153-161 #317019fb98b5
#c47[i4] The parser validates that every probe has at least one associated answer line starting with '='.
