#c48[i3] The serialize function automatically selects HCS/0.3 if probe tags are present, otherwise it defaults to HCS/0.2.
  > src/format.ts::serialize #ae589dcd81a8
#c49[i3] Key-value pairs in meta and certificates are serialized by replacing double quotes with single quotes and quoting values containing spaces.
  > src/format.ts::quote #c59249a65a00
#c50[i4] Claims with 'high' severity findings are tagged as 'suspect' and excluded from renders, while 'low' severity findings are only reported for human review.
