#c55[i3] The isHighRisk function returns true if any finding in the provided text has a severity level of 'high'.
  > src/guard.ts::isHighRisk #70492a90d9bb
#c56[i4] The scanSource function performs a line-by-line scan of source text to report injection-like patterns with their file path and line number.
  > src/guard.ts::scanSource #4653fed397c1
#c57[i5] The createLLM function parses a provider-prefixed model spec, initializes usage tracking, optionally applies reasoning effort from options or HCS_REASONING_EFFORT, and sets up rate limiting if HCS_RPM or rpm option is provided.
  > src/llm.ts::createLLM #e1653e3a53e5
#c58[i3] The withDebugLog function appends every request and reply or error as a JSON line to the file specified by HCS_DEBUG_LOG without logging headers.
