  > src/llm.ts::retryDelayMs #53c59bd9ac2f
#c61[i4] The postJSON function retries failed requests up to 6 attempts with exponential backoff, throwing a QuotaError if rate limits or quota are exhausted or if the server remains unavailable.
  > src/llm.ts::postJSON #d1a90aeac977
#c62[i4] The openAICompatible client automatically retries once with REASONING_BUDGET (4096 tokens) if a reasoning model consumes its whole output budget on hidden reasoning, resulting in an empty content and a length finish reason.
  > src/llm.ts::openAICompatible.complete #e699f36cd40d
#c63[i3] The extractJSON function attempts to extract and parse the first JSON object from a model reply, falling back to repairJSON on candidate strings if standard parsing fails.
